{"kind":"FETCH","data":{"headers":{},"body":"{\"id\":61698,\"title\":\"Galavant\",\"tagline\":\"Sing his name.\",\"overview\":\"Once upon a time, the dashing hero, Prince Galavant lost the love of his life, Madalena, to the evil King Richard. Now, our fallen hero is ready to take revenge and restore his “happily ever after.” But it won't be without a few twists and turns along the way in this fairytale musical.\",\"posterPath\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/3q9a5WFsf08v8RQYVfI2DzNd7B4.jpg\",\"backdropPath\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/cP8qN7GktiE5aE3ddrfAbV2lre6.jpg\",\"youtubeBackdrop\":null,\"anilistBanner\":null,\"rating\":7.3,\"voteCount\":174,\"year\":2015,\"genres\":[\"Comedy\"],\"status\":\"Canceled\",\"type\":\"tv\",\"totalSeasons\":2,\"totalEpisodes\":18,\"createdBy\":[\"Dan Fogelman\"],\"networks\":[\"ABC\"],\"countries\":[{\"code\":\"US\",\"name\":\"United States of America\"}],\"lastAirDate\":\"2016-01-31\",\"cast\":[{\"id\":58316,\"name\":\"John Fortenberry\",\"character\":\"Director\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/cDOXgCxHBqIKVr4lkB6R89QoiqO.jpg\"},{\"id\":58059,\"name\":\"Chris Koch\",\"character\":\"Director\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/vALNrvfLdegBRy8aME1Ge8LLeeY.jpg\"},{\"id\":1683083,\"name\":\"Paul Murphy\",\"character\":\"Director\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/e8Xia5ZoOjCW4IRqOsgf5m5TW2H.jpg\"},{\"id\":81809,\"name\":\"Declan Lowney\",\"character\":\"Director\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/gifQLUyUWQLx6WeMqhZkldeuVCm.jpg\"},{\"id\":220997,\"name\":\"James Griffiths\",\"character\":\"Director\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/uLXeKpTHZtYbDoFDUM6EK6gc4zo.jpg\"},{\"id\":1171526,\"name\":\"Joshua Sasse\",\"character\":\"Galavant\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/hyPkmjkD4AuwMiSr9HZTmAyRWHs.jpg\"},{\"id\":134423,\"name\":\"Timothy Omundson\",\"character\":\"King Richard\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/fPhLMiodU7mVegOYvJ8aoj84ZHJ.jpg\"},{\"id\":980,\"name\":\"Vinnie Jones\",\"character\":\"Gareth\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/tkYWG9gY2QpoBfOh4OWNz8yQfsw.jpg\"},{\"id\":1296084,\"name\":\"Mallory Jansen\",\"character\":\"Madalena\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/azShNsfOJnAf0MN3FaqBpxks7uP.jpg\"},{\"id\":79124,\"name\":\"Karen David\",\"character\":\"Isabella\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/zi4fUbrhvXqufdR4Ws7WflNUGLs.jpg\"},{\"id\":871100,\"name\":\"Luke Youngblood\",\"character\":\"Sid\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/fUHblnZSNAf1AnbPLMhDE16Sen.jpg\"}],\"trailers\":[{\"key\":\"uwC5lK8OK7I\",\"name\":\"Galavant: A New Comedy Extravaganza\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"},{\"key\":\"ayzw6htpi2Y\",\"name\":\"Galavant Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"}],\"similar\":[{\"id\":130350,\"title\":\"Sunset\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/xJB2y10qE8TIrlmC4Rk9LAIIKiw.jpg\",\"rating\":8.7,\"year\":2021,\"type\":\"tv\",\"_score\":0.4173076923076923,\"_genreOverlap\":1},{\"id\":31628,\"title\":\"Pair of Kings\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/k8OQOO5DWtBTgTtc1xoXxYSCy5O.jpg\",\"rating\":7.7,\"year\":2010,\"type\":\"tv\",\"_score\":0.41714285714285715,\"_genreOverlap\":1},{\"id\":62819,\"title\":\"Another Period\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/sEzplvZRKoFxiF7x6bG5dffiTwy.jpg\",\"rating\":6.8,\"year\":2015,\"type\":\"tv\",\"_score\":0.41139240506329117,\"_genreOverlap\":1},{\"id\":2187,\"title\":\"Reno 911!\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/jIoeMgmcGdgTDqQUq4sDWFNsPUD.jpg\",\"rating\":7.3,\"year\":2003,\"type\":\"tv\",\"_score\":0.4109756097560976,\"_genreOverlap\":1},{\"id\":246153,\"title\":\"Precious Plum\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/mO87o3xzOas1Q8rh3zobsqINc5.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"year\":2013,\"type\":\"tv\",\"_score\":0.41016949152542376,\"_genreOverlap\":1},{\"id\":62794,\"title\":\"Mellom bakkar og berg\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/r418zSmYs6IY87VbW1KA5aI5RvC.jpg\",\"rating\":6.5,\"year\":2015,\"type\":\"tv\",\"_score\":0.4085714285714286,\"_genreOverlap\":1},{\"id\":314347,\"title\":\"Phone: The Musical Series\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/sO3wjJ4qQi8R8jB7VeU3UiDmfik.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"year\":2026,\"type\":\"tv\",\"_score\":0.40576923076923077,\"_genreOverlap\":1},{\"id\":96883,\"title\":\"4 EXTRAÑOS EN DC\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/E7gvFQf3hWZadRtgCC30hvl7SG.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"year\":2011,\"type\":\"tv\",\"_score\":0.4,\"_genreOverlap\":1}],\"seasonNumber\":1,\"seasonName\":\"Season 1\",\"seasonOverview\":\"The first season centers on handsome knight Galavant and his quest for revenge over the King who stole his one true love.\",\"seasonPoster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/gU5aepKgpfta1XvamNj44eNhkx5.jpg\",\"seasonAirDate\":\"2015-01-04\",\"episodes\":[{\"number\":1,\"name\":\"Pilot\",\"overview\":\"When heroic, charming and handsome Sir Galavant loses his true love, the beautiful Madalena, to evil King Richard's wealth and power, he falls into a deep and drunken despair. Just as our hero hits rock bottom, Princess Isabella shows up with a quest to save her kingdom, defeat the despicable King Richard, and provide an opportunity for Galavant to reclaim Madalena. Galavant is off to become a hero again and strike a blow for true love…but first, Galavant has to fit into his old hero pants.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/cFPmS94o3nwAq4HZ8adiYW6oria.jpg\",\"rating\":6.6,\"voteCount\":14,\"airDate\":\"2015-01-04\",\"runtime\":22},{\"number\":2,\"name\":\"Joust Friends\",\"overview\":\"Galavant enters a jousting tournament against a boastful rival, Sir Jean Hamm, to test his return to heroic form (and win some much-needed traveling money and a really nice rooster). But it quickly becomes clear that Galavant is a long shot to win. Meanwhile, King Richard asks Gareth to help him become a bit more macho so that Madalena won't despise him quite so much.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/gyYGB3nwgsiYW6DicPQAYdA4Gjr.jpg\",\"rating\":6.7,\"voteCount\":15,\"airDate\":\"2015-01-04\",\"runtime\":22},{\"number\":3,\"name\":\"Two Balls\",\"overview\":\"A visit to Sid's hometown reveals he has not been truthful about his career path. While Galavant and Isabella back up Sid's stories, King Richard decides to throw a ball to cheer up the people of Valencia.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/cCR1oS0reSc0T1uJnPXi9dG5c7u.jpg\",\"rating\":6.5,\"voteCount\":14,\"airDate\":\"2015-01-11\",\"runtime\":22},{\"number\":4,\"name\":\"Comedy Gold\",\"overview\":\"An encounter with land-bound pirates forces Galavant, Isabella and Sid to learn how to get over their petty squabbles and work together. Meanwhile, King Richard tries a new tact to win Madalena's love.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/oTdAgGBQgthYkzvM72sATjgLGqH.jpg\",\"rating\":6,\"voteCount\":16,\"airDate\":\"2015-01-11\",\"runtime\":22},{\"number\":5,\"name\":\"Completely Mad... Alena\",\"overview\":\"As our heroic trio finally approaches Valencia, they find shelter and doo-wop among local monks who have taken a vow of singing, led by Confessional Monk. Madalena, frustrated with King Richard, decides to take matters into her own hands with her own devious plot involving the besotted Chef and her winsome handmaiden, Gwynne.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/1TZjUdshqtfwWw6ApuwN7ddAf3g.jpg\",\"rating\":6.9,\"voteCount\":14,\"airDate\":\"2015-01-18\",\"runtime\":22},{\"number\":6,\"name\":\"Dungeons and Dragon Lady\",\"overview\":\"While Galavant struggles with the realization about his true love, King Richard goes on a voyage of self-discovery, thanks to a potion from the magician, Xanax. As Galavant draws closer to the woman he really loves, an emboldened King Richard starts to assert himself, just as his meaner, elder brother returns—Kingsley.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/oGZj7qrJEK07hKwIia21HXCAUBS.jpg\",\"rating\":7.2,\"voteCount\":13,\"airDate\":\"2015-01-18\",\"runtime\":22},{\"number\":7,\"name\":\"My Cousin Izzy\",\"overview\":\"Thinking about being in a relationship, Isabella wants Galavant to try to impress her parents with attentive small talk, but he’s confident that breaking everyone out of prison will impress them and save them from certain death. Galavant gets his opportunity for a hero moment when King Richard challenges his brother to a duel and needs a champion to fight for him.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/8I15s7UZqumYs6X04lalwrrMKqM.jpg\",\"rating\":7.2,\"voteCount\":14,\"airDate\":\"2015-01-25\",\"runtime\":22},{\"number\":8,\"name\":\"It's All in the Executions\",\"overview\":\"Galavant enlists King Richard in a plot to kill Kingsley before the duel… but ends with a drunken whimper. Will Gareth kill King Richard in the duel? Will Galavant rescue everyone? Will Madalena find a new “boy toy?” The answers are very different from what you expect.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/1i733MJdXtN28BDsnnzEXCbzMlW.jpg\",\"rating\":7.1,\"voteCount\":15,\"airDate\":\"2015-01-25\",\"runtime\":22}],\"firstAirDate\":\"2015-01-04\"}","status":200,"url":""},"revalidate":86400,"tags":[]}